        "procedure": "General method for 2–6 under aerobic/ambient conditions: a solution of N-t-butyldiethanolamine (H2L2; 0.32 g, 2 mmol) in MeCN (5 mL) was added gradually to a stirred solution of Mn(OAc)2·4H2O (0.025 g, 0.1 mmol), pivalic acid (0.071 g, 0.7 mmol), and Ln(NO3)3·6H2O (0.8 mmol) in MeCN (20 mL). The brown solution was stirred for 2 h and filtered. Pale-brown plate crystals of 2–6 formed after 48–72 h. Compound 2 was isolated as 2·5MeCN.",
